1
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:07,250
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

2
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:11,860
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

3
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:16,120
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

4
00:00:16,310 --> 00:00:20,330
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

5
00:00:20,670 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

6
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:24,730
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

7
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:26,880
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

8
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:28,760
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

9
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:30,650
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

10
00:00:30,930 --> 00:00:33,320
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

11
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:35,800
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

12
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:40,560
♪Come, share a cup with me♪

13
00:00:40,570 --> 00:00:42,540
(Welcome to Cold Palace Refreshments)

14
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:47,040
=Farm Busily in the Cold Palace=

15
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:48,620
(Based on Hongshu.com's novel
I'm Busy Farming in the Cold Palace)

16
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:49,650
=Episode 19=

17
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:02,039
Burn it.

18
00:01:03,640 --> 00:01:04,400
Your Highness.

19
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:06,879
Your mugwort bath is ready.

20
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:09,400
We'll fumigate your robes with it too.

21
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:10,640
Why bother fumigating them?

22
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:11,480
Burn them all.

23
00:01:14,799 --> 00:01:16,319
If His Majesty dies,

24
00:01:16,439 --> 00:01:18,319
which prince will succeed him?

25
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:20,959
The Fourth Prince's boy

26
00:01:21,799 --> 00:01:23,799
has just learned to say grandmother.

27
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:29,040
A young child knows who cares for him.

28
00:01:38,159 --> 00:01:39,959
Send the mute servant at once.

29
00:01:40,439 --> 00:01:44,239
Deliver the letter to Xiqing's emperor
in person.

30
00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:45,719
Yes, Your Majesty.

31
00:01:58,680 --> 00:02:02,280
What a wonderful day.

32
00:02:12,759 --> 00:02:14,159
His pulse has steadied!

33
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:19,560
His fever has broken too.

34
00:02:25,639 --> 00:02:26,080
Hey!

35
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:26,840
Ji Wujue.

36
00:02:29,639 --> 00:02:30,360
I'm fine.

37
00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:31,680
What do you mean, fine?

38
00:02:34,639 --> 00:02:36,080
It's reached your heart!

39
00:02:36,080 --> 00:02:36,879
You call that fine?

40
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:37,960
Mind your tongue!

41
00:02:38,560 --> 00:02:40,680
You're dying! Forget about manners!

42
00:02:44,039 --> 00:02:44,840
Sir,

43
00:02:45,639 --> 00:02:48,080
treat His Majesty using my method.

44
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:49,639
Yes, Your Majesty.

45
00:02:52,919 --> 00:02:54,000
Lu Yunluo.

46
00:02:55,520 --> 00:02:57,159
If I don't survive this...

47
00:02:59,080 --> 00:02:59,879
I'll remarry.

48
00:03:13,639 --> 00:03:14,680
Your Majesty.

49
00:03:15,319 --> 00:03:16,840
Are you ready?

50
00:03:20,719 --> 00:03:21,719
We can defy fate.

51
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:23,680
Things will turn around.

52
00:03:27,759 --> 00:03:29,439
Your Highness, terrible news!

53
00:03:29,599 --> 00:03:30,639
His Majesty...

54
00:03:30,639 --> 00:03:31,960
His Majesty has caught the disease!

55
00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:32,479
Insolence!

56
00:03:33,039 --> 00:03:34,479
His Majesty is the Son of Heaven,

57
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:36,120
protected by the imperial dragon.

58
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:37,840
How could he catch that vile disease?

59
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:39,680
It's true!

60
00:03:39,919 --> 00:03:42,240
The Empress Dowager only returned from
Shuxin Hall yesterday.

61
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:45,639
I hear Empress Lu got there first to
nurse him.

62
00:03:45,639 --> 00:03:47,000
Lu Yunluo again!

63
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:48,319
Must she always steal the show?

64
00:03:48,319 --> 00:03:49,960
The Empress Dowager has decreed

65
00:03:50,080 --> 00:03:51,960
all consorts take turns nursing him.

66
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:54,560
The sedan's waited an hour.

67
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:56,639
What's the rush?

68
00:03:56,639 --> 00:03:58,520
Let me get dressed and do my makeup.

69
00:03:58,680 --> 00:03:59,960
If I may, Your Highness,

70
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:01,599
this disease has no cure.

71
00:04:01,599 --> 00:04:03,800
No one who catches it lasts seven days.

72
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:06,840
They rot to death in terrible agony.

73
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:10,879
Your Highness.

74
00:04:10,879 --> 00:04:12,639
Your sedan is ready.

75
00:04:14,199 --> 00:04:16,839
Why is my heart racing and I'm short of
breath?

76
00:04:17,079 --> 00:04:19,439
Could my old illness be acting up?

77
00:04:19,439 --> 00:04:21,279
Your health comes first, Your Highness.

78
00:04:21,279 --> 00:04:24,240
Why not go once you've recovered?

79
00:04:24,519 --> 00:04:25,680
No.

80
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:27,279
His Majesty is ill.

81
00:04:27,279 --> 00:04:28,680
Even if I have to crawl,

82
00:04:29,079 --> 00:04:31,360
I'll make it to Shuxin Hall.

83
00:04:31,480 --> 00:04:32,680
Your Highness, get up!

84
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:33,519
Quickly!

85
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:38,160
Someone, help!

86
00:04:38,160 --> 00:04:39,439
Her Highness has fainted!

87
00:04:39,439 --> 00:04:39,800
I'll...

88
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:41,399
I'll fetch the physician!

89
00:04:43,279 --> 00:04:44,079
Your Highness.

90
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:45,519
Go.

91
00:04:45,519 --> 00:04:48,120
Replace all incense in
Lixia Palace with mugwort.

92
00:04:48,519 --> 00:04:49,319
Use twice as much.

93
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:50,120
No.

94
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:50,920
Three times as much!

95
00:04:51,319 --> 00:04:52,160
Yes, Your Highness.

96
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:54,759
Hurry!

97
00:04:54,759 --> 00:04:56,959
Bring me my jade statue of the Goddess
of Mercy.

98
00:04:57,279 --> 00:04:59,319
I'll fast and bathe,

99
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:03,000
and chant prayers for His Majesty.

100
00:05:11,780 --> 00:05:14,720
(Treatise on Epidemics and Illnesses)

101
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:15,639
(Your Highness.)

102
00:05:15,639 --> 00:05:18,079
(Matron Wang has brought the Empress
Dowager's decree.)

103
00:05:19,199 --> 00:05:20,360
Let her wait

104
00:05:20,399 --> 00:05:21,800
until I finish this page.

105
00:05:24,439 --> 00:05:27,160
Consort Lan, Her Majesty commands

106
00:05:27,160 --> 00:05:30,560
all consorts to nurse the Emperor in
Shuxin Hall at once.

107
00:05:32,519 --> 00:05:34,240
His Majesty truly has smallpox?

108
00:05:34,519 --> 00:05:35,759
Of course he does.

109
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:38,800
Consort Yao just had a flare-up of her
old illness.

110
00:05:39,199 --> 00:05:41,639
Only you can nurse him now.

111
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:45,079
How convenient.

112
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:47,040
Wenxing.

113
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:49,959
Fetch the Snow Mushroom from my dowry.

114
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:50,920
Your Highness!

115
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:53,319
Your father traded three cities for it!

116
00:05:53,319 --> 00:05:54,399
A life is at stake.

117
00:05:54,399 --> 00:05:56,079
Medicine is meant to save lives.

118
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:58,720
Yes, Your Highness.

119
00:06:01,399 --> 00:06:02,639
But I will not

120
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:04,120
go to Shuxin Hall.

121
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:05,879
Consort Lan!

122
00:06:06,519 --> 00:06:08,439
You defy Her Majesty's decree?

123
00:06:11,279 --> 00:06:12,639
Have you forgotten

124
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:15,600
why I came from Liu to marry here?

125
00:06:16,279 --> 00:06:18,560
If I leave Liuyun Palace today,

126
00:06:18,879 --> 00:06:20,800
tomorrow Liu's cavalry

127
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:22,680
will overrun Donglan's borderlands.

128
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:23,720
You!

129
00:06:25,079 --> 00:06:29,240
You're using the truce as leverage?

130
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:33,160
My father sent me here to marry,

131
00:06:33,439 --> 00:06:34,959
not to die.

132
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:37,040
Kindly inform Her Majesty

133
00:06:37,439 --> 00:06:39,120
that Liuyun Palace is now sealed.

134
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:40,199
No visitors.

135
00:06:40,319 --> 00:06:42,399
Show her out.

136
00:06:42,399 --> 00:06:43,319
(Fine.)

137
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:44,680
(Very well.)

138
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:46,560
(Your arrogance won't last.)

139
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:49,319
(Once a new emperor takes the throne and
Lu dies of illness,)

140
00:06:49,519 --> 00:06:52,639
(that shabby Cold Palace courtyard will
be your home.)

141
00:06:52,839 --> 00:06:53,639
Hmph.

142
00:06:56,279 --> 00:06:58,199
Your Highness, the Snow Mushroom is
here.

143
00:07:00,120 --> 00:07:02,120
Is anyone looking after Yunluo?

144
00:07:02,759 --> 00:07:04,079
Her Majesty

145
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:06,680
is nursing him at his bedside.

146
00:07:07,959 --> 00:07:08,839
What a fool.

147
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:11,560
Wenxing.

148
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:13,839
Take this to Deputy Physician Chen at
the Imperial Medical Office.

149
00:07:13,839 --> 00:07:15,560
Have him send all the herbs from my
private stores

150
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:16,759
to Shuxin Hall.

151
00:07:16,759 --> 00:07:17,920
From today,

152
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:19,839
everyone in Liuyun Palace
must take daily herbal baths.

153
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:21,759
No one may set foot outside.

154
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:23,399
Yes, Your Highness.

155
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:29,240
(Yunluo,)

156
00:07:30,079 --> 00:07:32,120
(you must hold on.)

157
00:07:58,560 --> 00:07:59,560
Lu Yunluo.

158
00:08:04,399 --> 00:08:05,199
Your Majesty!

159
00:08:06,879 --> 00:08:07,759
You're awake.

160
00:08:08,480 --> 00:08:09,279
Easy.

161
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:15,920
You...

162
00:08:15,920 --> 00:08:17,680
How long have you gone without sleep?

163
00:08:20,639 --> 00:08:22,360
I've lost count.

164
00:08:22,800 --> 00:08:24,720
She's watched over you for three days,

165
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:26,639
barely taking a sip of water.

166
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:39,679
Then

167
00:08:41,039 --> 00:08:42,159
I've pulled through?

168
00:08:42,759 --> 00:08:43,360
Yes.

169
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:45,559
Her Majesty is truly extraordinary.

170
00:08:45,879 --> 00:08:47,519
You're out of danger now.

171
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:49,919
A few days' rest will see you well.

172
00:08:54,039 --> 00:08:55,080
Your Majesty, are you hungry?

173
00:08:55,320 --> 00:08:56,320
That wasn't me.

174
00:08:56,919 --> 00:08:57,639
Was it you?

175
00:08:57,639 --> 00:08:58,200
Huh?

176
00:08:58,559 --> 00:08:59,679
Not me either.

177
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:02,279
I'm starving!

178
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:11,879
I'm alive!

179
00:09:16,679 --> 00:09:18,159
What are you doing here?

180
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:19,799
She saved your life.

181
00:09:21,879 --> 00:09:23,080
Brother,

182
00:09:23,440 --> 00:09:24,600
is that true?

183
00:09:25,679 --> 00:09:27,600
I can vouch for it.

184
00:09:29,919 --> 00:09:30,639
Tell me.

185
00:09:30,639 --> 00:09:32,240
What reward would you like?

186
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:38,600
I'd like you

187
00:09:39,080 --> 00:09:41,120
to take off your clothes.

188
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:41,879
What?

189
00:09:42,559 --> 00:09:43,360
You...

190
00:09:44,200 --> 00:09:44,759
Huh?

191
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:47,799
You...

192
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:50,039
You want...

193
00:09:50,039 --> 00:09:51,519
Why must I take off my clothes?

194
00:09:52,200 --> 00:09:53,799
Don't be afraid, Your Highness.

195
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:55,360
I only need to cut out a little flesh.

196
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:56,559
Just bear it a moment.

197
00:09:57,519 --> 00:09:59,559
I've only just escaped death,

198
00:09:59,559 --> 00:10:00,919
and now you want to flay me alive?

199
00:10:00,919 --> 00:10:03,000
Scabs and pus from smallpox survivors

200
00:10:03,159 --> 00:10:04,440
can make lifesaving medicine.

201
00:10:04,919 --> 00:10:05,759
Your Highness,

202
00:10:06,200 --> 00:10:08,240
don't you want to save the people of
Shangyuan?

203
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:16,240
Take them off.

204
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:17,080
Lives come first.

205
00:10:17,399 --> 00:10:17,960
Hey!

206
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:19,080
Don't look.

207
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:21,279
I'll do it.

208
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:26,279
Brother!

209
00:10:26,279 --> 00:10:27,080
You...

210
00:10:27,759 --> 00:10:29,200
Watch where you're cutting!

211
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:30,840
Relax.

212
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:32,720
I know how much force to use.

213
00:10:36,759 --> 00:10:37,840
I'm well now.

214
00:10:38,600 --> 00:10:39,519
Ow!

215
00:10:39,799 --> 00:10:42,120
I'm not!

216
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:44,159
Cao Zhongquan.

217
00:10:44,159 --> 00:10:45,480
Have the imperial kitchen

218
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:46,200
prepare a meal.

219
00:10:47,759 --> 00:10:49,080
You can eat again!

220
00:10:49,759 --> 00:10:51,200
You're truly recovered!

221
00:10:52,240 --> 00:10:53,960
Donglan is saved!

222
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,200
The late Emperor blessed us!

223
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:57,600
Our ancestors have answered our prayers!

224
00:10:57,759 --> 00:10:59,200
Ha-ha!

225
00:11:21,400 --> 00:11:25,430
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

226
00:11:25,820 --> 00:11:30,040
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

227
00:11:30,080 --> 00:11:34,260
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

228
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:38,510
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

229
00:11:38,850 --> 00:11:42,910
♪Cool dew, starry nights,
wheat sprouts in my hands♪

230
00:11:42,980 --> 00:11:47,160
♪I shape fields, not painted brows,
and fill them with hope♪

231
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:50,970
♪Gold and silver bloom from the soil♪

232
00:11:51,440 --> 00:11:56,120
♪I smile as the world storms on♪

233
00:11:57,780 --> 00:11:59,930
♪No finery to rival spring♪

234
00:12:00,110 --> 00:12:04,410
♪All I wish for are waves of green♪

235
00:12:06,820 --> 00:12:08,570
♪Where is beauty found?♪

236
00:12:08,750 --> 00:12:13,180
♪Just lift your eyes and see♪

237
00:12:13,740 --> 00:12:15,310
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

238
00:12:15,330 --> 00:12:17,800
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

239
00:12:17,870 --> 00:12:19,950
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

240
00:12:20,110 --> 00:12:21,880
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

241
00:12:22,490 --> 00:12:23,760
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

242
00:12:23,990 --> 00:12:26,390
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

243
00:12:26,630 --> 00:12:28,930
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

244
00:12:29,210 --> 00:12:33,530
♪Come, share a cup with me♪
